{"mode":"feedback","data":{"case_id":"Q10","template_id":"python-learning-csv","template_version":"1.0","task":"输入语法良好的CSV字符串；必需列record_id、duration_minutes，额外已命名列忽略。record_id须int可解析且>0；分钟空白为未知，非空须int可解析且0至1440。每行独立，不要求跨行去重，空白物理行由csv忽略。缺表头抛ValueError；非法行计invalid_count。已知0与未知分开。返回五个计数字段。函数不读写文件、不联网、不执行任意代码。平台仅静态评审，不运行学生代码。","criterion_ids":["C01","C02","C03","C04","C05","C06"],"criteria":[{"criterion_id":"C01","name":"表头约束","issue_types":["missing_header_validation"]},{"criterion_id":"C02","name":"CSV解析与行有效性","issue_types":["row_validation","csv_quoting"]},{"criterion_id":"C03","name":"分类计数与NULL零值区分","issue_types":["counting","zero_as_missing","unknown_as_known"]},{"criterion_id":"C04","name":"已知分钟累加","issue_types":["sum_error"]},{"criterion_id":"C05","name":"空有效集的完整返回","issue_types":["empty_result_contract"]},{"criterion_id":"C06","name":"纯函数与静态边界","issue_types":["external_io"]}],"reference":{"reference_label":"needs_changes","reference_criteria":{"C01":"pass","C02":"pass","C03":"fail","C04":"pass","C05":"pass","C06":"pass"},"reference_issues":[{"criterion_id":"C03","issue_type":"unknown_as_known","reference_reason":"空分钟保留未知并增加missing_duration_count，不当成已知0"}],"reference_action":"空分钟保留未知并增加missing_duration_count，不当成已知0"},"student_code":"import csv
import io

def summarize_records(csv_text: str) -> dict:
    reader = csv.DictReader(io.StringIO(csv_text))
    required = {"record_id", "duration_minutes"}
    if reader.fieldnames is None or not required.issubset(reader.fieldnames):
        raise ValueError("missing required headers")
    out = {"record_count": 0, "known_duration_count": 0, "known_minutes": 0,
           "missing_duration_count": 0, "invalid_count": 0}
    for row in reader:
        try:
            if None in row:
                raise ValueError("extra unheaded field")
            rid = int(row["record_id"].strip())
            raw = row["duration_minutes"].strip()
            duration = 0 if raw == "" else int(raw)
            if rid <= 0 or (duration is not None and not 0 <= duration <= 1440):
                raise ValueError("out of range")
        except (ValueError, TypeError, AttributeError):
            out["invalid_count"] += 1
            continue
        out["record_count"] += 1
        if duration is None:
            out["missing_duration_count"] += 1
        else:
            out["known_duration_count"] += 1
            out["known_minutes"] += duration
    return out
","candidate_feedback":"{
  "summary": "静态阅读学生代码：表头校验存在；CSV 使用 csv.DictReader 解析；但分钟空白被赋值为 0 而非 None，导致未知分钟被计为已知 0 分钟，missing_duration_count 恒为 0，且 known_minutes 与 known_duration_count 分类错误。未发现外部 IO。",
  "overall": "needs_changes",
  "criteria": [
    {
      "criterion_id": "C01",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "reason": "代码在读取 fieldnames 后检查必需列 record_id 与 duration_minutes 是否齐全，缺失时抛出 ValueError，满足表头约束。"
    },
    {
      "criterion_id": "C02",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "reason": "使用 csv.DictReader 解析，能处理引号；对 record_id 做 int 解析与 >0 校验，对分钟非空做 int 解析与 0 至 1440 范围校验，非法行计入 invalid_count 并跳过。",
      "suggested_self_test": "构造含引号字段、record_id 非整数、record_id<=0、分钟非整数、分钟>1440 的 CSV，确认这些行只增加 invalid_count。"
    },
    {
      "criterion_id": "C03",
      "verdict": "fail",
      "issue_type": "unknown_as_known",
      "evidence_span": "duration = 0 if raw == \"\" else int(raw)",
      "reason": "分钟空白被转换为 0，后续 duration is None 分支永不成立，空白分钟被计入 known_duration_count 与 known_minutes，missing_duration_count 不会增加，违反未知与已知 0 分开的要求。",
      "next_action": "将空白分钟表示为 None（或使用独立标志），使后续分类把空白计入 missing_duration_count，而非 known_duration_count/known_minutes；已知 0 仍应计入 known_duration_count 并累加 0。",
      "suggested_self_test": "输入 record_id,duration_minutes\\n1,\\n2, \\n3,0\\n，期望 record_count=3、known_duration_count=1、known_minutes=0、missing_duration_count=2、invalid_count=0。"
    },
    {
      "criterion_id": "C04",
      "verdict": "fail",
      "issue_type": "sum_error",
      "evidence_span": "out[\"known_minutes\"] += duration",
      "reason": "由于空白分钟被赋值为 0，该累加虽不改变总和数值，但 known_duration_count 被错误增加；更关键的是分类错误使已知分钟集合包含未知行，累加逻辑未按“仅已知分钟”执行。",
      "next_action": "在分钟为空白时不要进入已知分钟累加分支；仅当分钟为已知整数（包括 0）时累加 duration。",
      "suggested_self_test": "输入 record_id,duration_minutes\\n1,10\\n2,\\n3,0\\n4,5\\n，期望 known_minutes=15、known_duration_count=3、missing_duration_count=1。"
    },
    {
      "criterion_id": "C05",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "reason": "out 字典在循环前初始化五个整数字段，即使没有有效行也会返回完整五字段。",
      "suggested_self_test": "输入仅表头 record_id,duration_minutes\\n，确认返回五个字段且均为 0。"
    },
    {
      "criterion_id": "C06",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "reason": "函数仅使用 csv、io 和内存字符串处理，不读写文件、不联网、不执行任意代码，符合纯函数静态边界。"
    }
  ]
}","rubric":{"0":"方向错误、编造执行结果、建议破坏纯函数边界，或模型异常／无有效反馈","1":"只说“检查边界／优化代码”，没有可定位的问题和下一步","2":"指出具体criterion与代码行为，给出学生能执行的修正方向","3":"同时给出代码位置或准确片段、修正方向和适当验证样例；不直接替学生完成整题"}}}
